		(at 45 25.84 180)
		(descr "Sunlord FNR6045 shielded power inductor, 6.0 x 6.0 x 4.5 mm, two bottom electrodes. LAND DERIVED, NOT A VENDOR DRAWING: the Sunlord series sheet is not fetchable from here (LCSC C168072 datasheet link returns HTML, 2026-09-25), so the pads are cut to the series' stated body 6.0 x 6.0 mm with the two bottom electrodes 1.8 mm wide and 2.2 mm apart: inner pad edges at +-1.10 (the stated gap, so no copper runs under the ferrite between the terminals) and outer edges 0.2 mm beyond the body. Check one part with a caliper before the first order.")
